Aaj hum Comparison Operators aur Logical Operators seekhenge. Ye tumhare AI Trading Agent ka brain banenge, kyunki AI ko decision lena hota hai.

1. Comparison Operators
Ye do values ko compare karte hain.

a = 10
b = 20

print(a > b)

output:
False

Kyunki 10, 20 se bada nahi hai.

Sabhi Comparison Operators
print(10 > 5)    # True
print(10 < 5)    # False
print(10 == 10)  # True
print(10 != 5)   # True
print(10 >= 10)  # True
print(10 <= 5)   # False

2. Logical Operator and
Agar dono conditions True hongi tabhi result True hoga.

trend_1d = True
trend_4h = True

print(trend_1d and trend_4h)

output:
True

3. Logical Operator or
Agar ek bhi condition True hai to result True hoga.

news = False
breakout = True

print(news or breakout)

output:
True

4. Trading Example
Ye example tumhari strategy se related hai.

trend = True
liquidity_sweep = True
choch = True

buy_signal = trend and liquidity_sweep and choch

print(buy_signal)

output:
True

Matlab AI bolega: "Buy Signal Confirmed"

5. Ek aur Example

trend = True
liquidity_sweep = False
choch = True

buy_signal = trend and liquidity_sweep and choch

print(buy_signal)

output:
False

Matlab AI trade nahi lega.

